<title>USA: Sunglass Hut Q4 shr loss $0.45.</title>
<headline>Sunglass Hut Q4 shr loss $0.45.</headline>
<dateline>CORAL GABLES, Fla. 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In millions of dollars)</p>
<p>					 Q4 ended Feb 1</p>
<p>				   1997		  1996</p>
<p>Sales			$  124.90	    $  106.6</p>
<p>Net income (loss)	   (24.40)		  4.9</p>
<p>Earnings (loss) per share  (0.45)		 0.09</p>
<p>					 Year ended</p>
<p>					 February 1,</p>
<p>				   1997		  1996</p>
<p>Sales			$  527.1	     $  413.6</p>
<p>Net income (loss)	     (.225)		28.4</p>
<p>Earnings (loss) per share    .00		   0.52</p>
<p>NOTES:</p>
<p>Year ended February 1, 1997 covers Fiscal Year 1996 and year ended February 1, 1996 covers Fiscal Year 1995.</p>
<p>Results for the fourth quarter and fiscal 1996 were negatively impacted by charges of $24.8 million or $18.8 million net of tax benefits, attributable to restructuring and store closing costs, reduced vendor margin and marketing support related to lower than expected fourth quarter sales, order cancellations and product returns and other expenses related to 1997 strategic initiatives.</p>
<p>Net income for Fiscal Year 1995 is exclusive of $10.1 million of non-recurring expenses related to acquisitions.</p>
<p>Full company name is Sunglass Hut International Inc.</p>
<p>--((New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
